The fishing skill is used to catch fish for the [[Smithing|smithing]] skill. They're mainly used to craft food that automatically heals you but are also used in some other crafts.

There are three tiers of fish, small medium and large. You unlock a new small fish every 6 levels, a new medium fish every 8 levels and a new large fish every 15 levels.

