The number of fish and the speed at which you catch them is determined by your power. These stats can also be influenced by objects crafted in the smithing skill and by perks from the perk tree.
[[File:Fishing.PNG|centre|thumb|800x800px]]Until v5.0 Afterlife, two bugs of fish gain still exists.  1st bug is after upgrading through Power (+/++), the amount of fish gain will show an unreasonable high increment.  After leaving the page and revisit fishing page again, the fish gain increment amount will be corrected.  2nd bug occurs when the player left the fishing page by clicking other main tab; and once clicking the Craft icon and automatically entering the fishing page again, the away fish amount gain will be extraordinarily low.  To overcome this bug, player is advised to click the smith tab before leaving to other areas.  By doing so, when the player click Craft tab, the smith tab will be loaded first.  Moving from smith tab to fish tab the fish gain amount will appear to be normal.
